Description: Enumerates polyomino tilings of grid graphs. Partitions an m by n
    grid into k connected pieces where each piece has a size within given
    bounds, under rook or queen contiguity rules. A translation of the Julia
    'enumerator' package by Schutzman (2019) <doi:10.5281/zenodo.3467675>.
